<title>USA: Niagara Mohawk Power Corp Q1 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Niagara Mohawk Power Corp Q1 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYRACUSE, N.Y. 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shr		 $0.65		    $0.60</p>
<p> Net		 103,022		  96,122</p>
<p> Oper Revs	 1,163,832		1,163,063</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  144,389		  144,333</p>
