<p> Oper Rev	  3,991,422		3,955,588</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  144,364		  144,331</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings for the 12-month period ended March 31, 1997, included an after-tax write-off of $67.4 million, or $0.47 per share, associated with the discontinued application of regulatory accounting principles to the company's fossil and hydro generation business. Excluding the extraordinary loss, earning forthe 12 months ended March 31, 1997, were $146.6 million, or $1.02 pershare.</p>
<p>Net before payment of preferred.</p>
